From 32582bb782b0e42fe9788e807a946d6604c0612f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 06:08:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vpl-gpu-rt: Set -std=c++14 on all C++ modules missing an
 explicit standard

A real build failed compiling umc_brc.cpp:
mfx_utils.h:342:36: error: no template named 'result_of' in namespace
'std'. std::result_of was deprecated in C++17 and removed in C++20;
the libumc_brc module in _studio/shared/umc/codec/Android.mk never set
an explicit -std flag, so it falls back to the Android toolchain's
default C++ standard, which has drifted to C++20+ over the years.

mfx_utils.h's own result_of<TRes(TArgs...)> specialization changed
upstream in intel-onevpl-26.2.3 to inherit from std::result_of
(previously an empty, self-contained specialization with no std
dependency at all) -- a real upstream regression for C++20-default
toolchains, but the minimal, non-invasive fix here is to give this
fork's affected modules the same -std=c++14 that
_studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk already uses, rather than altering
upstream's header logic.

Audited every Android.mk module in this fork that compiles C++
sources: only _studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk had an explicit -std flag.
The other 10 module blocks across umc/core, umc/io, umc/codec (x2),
mfx_logging, mfx_trace, asc (x3), and enctools/aenc had none --
fixing all of them now rather than rediscovering each one through
further multi-hour build-fail cycles.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 _studio/enctools/aenc/Android.mk      | 2 ++
 _studio/shared/asc/Android.mk         | 6 ++++++
 _studio/shared/mfx_logging/Android.mk | 2 ++
 _studio/shared/mfx_trace/Android.mk   | 2 ++
 _studio/shared/umc/codec/Android.mk   | 4 ++++
 _studio/shared/umc/core/Android.mk    | 2 ++
 _studio/shared/umc/io/Android.mk      | 2 ++
 7 files changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/_studio/enctools/aenc/Android.mk b/_studio/enctools/aenc/Android.mk
index 0642b0dc..b68544a4 100644
--- a/_studio/enctools/aenc/Android.mk
+++ b/_studio/enctools/aenc/Android.mk
@@ -21,6 +21,8 @@ LOCAL_CFLAGS := \
 LOCAL_CFLAGS_32 := $(MFX_CFLAGS_INTERNAL_32)
 LOCAL_CFLAGS_64 := $(MFX_CFLAGS_INTERNAL_64)
 
+LOCAL_CPPFLAGS += -std=c++14
+
 LOCAL_MODULE_TAGS := optional
 LOCAL_MODULE := libmfx_aenc
 include $(BUILD_STATIC_LIBRARY)
